{"id":"e09695d13f301942","group":"92","path":"92/92-prop-rec-equal-tm.md","title":"Recursive = Turing Computable","display":"prop-rec-equal-tm — Recursive = Turing Computable","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-prop-rec-equal-tm","aliases":["92-prop-rec-equal-tm"],"display":"prop-rec-equal-tm — Recursive = Turing Computable","depends_on":["[[92-df-recursive-function]]","[[92-df-mu-recursive]]"],"source":"本地递归论补充；原书第 IV 章附录 pp. 53–54 只给关系刻画","source_status":"原书之外的形式计算模型等价"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-prop-rec-equal-tm"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-prop-rec-equal-tm</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-rec-equal-tm — Recursive = Turing Computable"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d65795dc15ebce4b\" href=\"?note=d65795dc15ebce4b\" title=\"92-df-recursive-function\">92-df-recursive-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"301cfe50f6e97873\" href=\"?note=301cfe50f6e97873\" title=\"92-df-mu-recursive\">92-df-mu-recursive</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"本地递归论补充；原书第 IV 章附录 pp. 53–54 只给关系刻画"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书之外的形式计算模型等价"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(f:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span> (arity and total function parameter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rec}(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{Rec}(f)\\)</span> (recursive-function predicate for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d65795dc15ebce4b\" href=\"?note=d65795dc15ebce4b\" title=\"92-df-recursive-function\">92-df-recursive-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TMComp}(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{TMComp}(f)\\)</span> (Turing-computable predicate in a fixed standard deterministic Turing-machine model with primitive-recursive finite-string, configuration, and tuple encodings)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}rec\\text{-}equal\\text{-}tm}\\vdash\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall f:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Rec}(f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{TMComp}(f)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}rec\\text{-}equal\\text{-}tm}\\vdash\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall f:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Rec}(f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{TMComp}(f)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>递归函数 = Turing可计算函数（对于全函数）</li>\n<li>这是两个形式计算模型之间的数学等价定理，不是把非形式的“有效可计算”同形式模型等同的Church–Turing论题</li>\n<li>μ递归 = PR + μ运算</li>\n<li>Turing机可以计算μ运算（搜索）</li>\n<li>μ运算对应Turing机的无限搜索</li>\n<li>正向：零、后继、投影有停机程序；复合与递归可按其结构模拟，严格最小化按 m=0,1,… 顺序模拟，前一值发散则搜索也发散。因而 PartRec 的每个构造有同域同值的部分图灵计算。</li>\n<li>反向：对一台固定机器，有限配置的初始码、一步更新、是否停机以及输出读取均可按有限字串编码作原始递归运算；t 步配置由原始递归迭代得到。以 μ 搜索第一个停机步数，再读取输出，得到同域同值的部分递归函数。若机器处处停机，则该函数总而满足 Rec。</li>\n<li>两个方向都已列出；只说明“图灵机能模拟 μ 搜索”不足以证明反方向</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>在用户所给 PDF 的正文检索中未发现此模型等价定理的证明。此条作为标准计算模型背景保留；有限机器编码是参数约定，未在该目录构建机器语法或机器核验。原书递归定义另见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"cc77d3ecb4f82cf1\" href=\"?note=cc77d3ecb4f82cf1\" title=\"92-df-smullyan-recursive-relations\">92-df-smullyan-recursive-relations</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"d65795dc15ebce4b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-recursive-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-mu-recursive","status":"resolved","id":"301cfe50f6e97873","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-mu-recursive]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"d65795dc15ebce4b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Rec}(f)$ (recursive-function predicate for $f$, see [[92-df-recursive-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-smullyan-recursive-relations","status":"resolved","id":"cc77d3ecb4f82cf1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Source]","excerpt":"在用户所给 PDF 的正文检索中未发现此模型等价定理的证明。此条作为标准计算模型背景保留；有限机器编码是参数约定，未在该目录构建机器语法或机器核验。原书递归定义另见 [[92-df-smullyan-recursive-relations]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rec}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TMComp}(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}rec\\text{-}equal\\text{-}tm}\\vdash\n\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\forall f:\\mathbb N^k\\to\\mathbb N\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Rec}(f)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{TMComp}(f)\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":2380,"backlinks":[{"id":"ac4388db49632759","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"这里 TMComp 在总函数上使用与 [[92-prop-rec-equal-tm]] 同一固定机器模型。PR⊆Rec 后由该模型等价得到 PR⊆TM；Ack 的可计算性与非 PR 需要 [[92-ex-ackermann-not-pr]] 的独立论证。原书未展开 Ackermann 比较，不把这一例当作其章节结论。"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-346","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-prop-rec-equal-tm]]"}],"outgoing":["d65795dc15ebce4b","301cfe50f6e97873","cc77d3ecb4f82cf1"]}